    "%@: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar tooltip: one line per reading, such as Fan 1: 1350 RPM or CPU: 45.2°C. The first argument is the name, the second the value.\nSettings footnote: one sensor choice and what it reads, such as Average: the average of the CPU cores. The first argument is the choice, the second its description.\nShortcuts: one line in the readings result, such as CPU: 45.2°C. The first argument is CPU or GPU, the second the temperature.\nShortcuts: one line per fan in the fan speed result, such as Fan 1: 1350 RPM. The first argument is the fan's name, the second its speed or Off.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
